+ Scope is Tuple

+ start U32

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ boundaries [Size]
    - source String
    - scopes [Scope]

**
    scopes
    *> each.start
**
    0 .. < source.length
    ?> source[each] == '\n'
**
    0 .. < source.length
    *> each + 1

